{
  "name": "Sale closed to Google review request",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Sale closed to Google review request\n\nWhen a sale closes or a job is done, it emails the customer **asking for a Google review** with your direct link, **once per email address**, and logs who was asked.\n\n**How it works:** webhook (sale or job completed), customer fields, email check, skip anyone already asked, review email, row in Google Sheets.\n\n**You need:** your Google Business Profile **review link**, a Gmail credential and Google Sheets.\n\nReviews feed the answers Google shows for your business. Asking right after a good experience, every time, is what gets them.\n\nFree template from kyndredai.com/templates. Runs on n8n 2.x, self-hosted or cloud.",
        "height": 291,
        "width": 1780,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        49
      ],
      "id": "93787cc3-15f8-46c7-bc0c-c31812531d0c",
      "name": "README"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "sale-closed",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "id": "2909ef2a-5274-47c1-a900-64b8b55c8b63",
      "name": "Sale closed (Webhook)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "3fbe677c-cf6a-4797-8086-bfc566a710d0",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.name || '').trim().slice(0, 100) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fbba8229-8853-45a3-8d07-7a19b22ae844",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.email || '').trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "dabcdd29-95e4-4157-8237-99e9a7d68ea6",
              "name": "asked_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd HH:mm') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ],
      "id": "ca8fb424-8775-4e46-a480-ed05e421173e",
      "name": "Customer fields"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c4974a45-9fde-473b-8e48-201b4feb3db5",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "rightValue": "^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        400
      ],
      "id": "9f0b4c29-aed0-4bb7-8407-4af0f0d32f62",
      "name": "Has a valid email?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "logic": "removeItemsWithAlreadySeenKeyValues",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        780,
        400
      ],
      "id": "751bd40e-08f3-41f1-843a-80d212024766",
      "name": "Ask each customer once"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Could you leave us a review, {{ $json.name }}?",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.name }},\n\nThanks for trusting us. If you had a good experience, a short Google review would help us a lot. It takes 30 seconds:\n\nYOUR_GOOGLE_REVIEW_LINK\n\nThank you. If anything went wrong, reply to this email and we will sort it out.",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        400
      ],
      "id": "6b161ea6-879a-494a-9d15-3d361fc3fc30",
      "name": "Ask for review (email)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
